 <ns0:name>MtKimball</ns0:name>
 <ns0:desc>Mt. Kimball is one of the high points of the Catalina front range.  The most direct route to the summit is from the Finger Rock Trail at the north end of Alvernon Way.  The trail is fairly rough and quite
steep for the first few miles.  </ns0:desc>
 <ns0:author>Scott Morris</ns0:author>
